// Race vocabulary: every race a creature may be, declared as an ordered
// entry list. Load assigns each id a runtime handle in entry order;
// handles are unstable across loads (entry order decides them), so saved
// data must translate through the id mapping, never store raw handles.
// Entry form (a record) leaves room for kernel fields to grow in place.
[ ( race: "human" ), ( race: "giant_white_rat" ) ]
